<title>USA: Investor raises Redwood Empire Bancorp stake.</title>
<headline>Investor raises Redwood Empire Bancorp stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>An investor in Redwood Empire Bancorp said he raised his stake in the company to 13.4 percent, or 369,300 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, B. John Barry said he bought 119,300 shares between January 31 and February 11 at prices ranging from $11.50 to $11.75 a share.</p>
</text>
